dialogs
1	A rocket launch demands perfection. Not even a 1% margin of error is allowed.Even if it's 99% okay, the whole thing is useless if 1% happens to be no good.Despite that, we never stop trying. Why? It's a dream that never ends.
2	I was taking a stroll down the beach when I found this.It's not anything I need, so you can have it.
5	Don't think you're on a roll just because you've beaten me!
6	Okay, I get it already! The next time, we'll come unannounced.
7	What are we going to do with the rocket fuel?How would I know? Ask our leader upstairs!
8	Our leader said no one, but no one, gets past me!
9	This is… An intent-to-steal notice?“To the staff of the SPACE CENTER: How are you? We are doing fine.“We will soon visit you to take your rocket fuel.“Please don't try to stop us. We will take the fuel no matter what.“Let there be more land! TEAM MAGMA”
10	STEVEN: PLAYER, have you read that proclamation already?TEAM MAGMA is coming after the rocket fuel on this island.I don't know what they'd need it for, but they can't be allowed to take it.I'll keep an eye on things for a while longer.In the meantime, why don't you go check out the town?
